  m_Name: Familiar
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FamiliarEffect
  _label: Familiar
  _description: 'Summons a pet (power = its HP) that takes hits for you. Mix it with
    another spell ("familiar fire") and the pet also casts that spell on the enemy
    once every turn: fire burns, ice freezes, water soaks, poison, fear, rainbow
    gives everything. Also cast as "pet".'
